# The commit of ozd the board's file and time host is built from.
#
# ozd is another project and is never patched here, exactly as muir is never
# patched here.  This file is the pin, and it is the only place the version is
# written: the Buildroot package reads it, so moving the pin moves the board's
# ozd with no other edit.  A 40-character SHA names one tree and nothing else,
# which is why there is no hash file beside it.
#
# There is no golden trace against ozd, so this pin is unlike muir.commit in
# one way: nothing in this repository is generated from it.  What it buys is
# that two builds of the same commit of this repository put the same ozd on
# the card.
e0dd18065d4ea0d2c80bce0beff03627acc293b6
